    "display_name": "Community Events",
    "long_instructions": "## Generate Data\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Look at the `event` object in the code.\r\n2. Highlight the object and prompt AI to generate an array of objects called `events`.\r\n3. Run the code and inspect the generated dataset.\r\n4. Look for patterns in the kinds of events and information that appear.\r\n",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/3f3c213e0cbac76cd0817eb9639ca150-community.png",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
