    "ai_tutor_prompt_settings": {
      "answerTypes": [
        "documentation",
        "buildJavaScript"
      ],
      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildJavaScript": "```js\nconst events = [ ... ]\n```\n\nwith exactly 8 event objects.\n\n**Object shape (fields may be missing or incomplete):**\n\n```js\n{\n  title: \"Neighborhood Festival\",\n  type: \"Festival\",\n  location: \"Central Park\",\n  date: \"2026-06-12\",\n  status: \"Open\",\n  audience: \"All Ages\",\n  image: \"festival_event.png\",\n  description: \"A fun outdoor event with food, music, and games for the whole family.\"\n}\n```\n\n**Constraints (bias + ordering):**\n\n* ≥4 outdoor/community-style events (festivals, markets, cleanups)\n* Exactly 1 small indoor event (book club or workshop)\n* Most events should be `\"Open\"`\n* Similar event types appear first\n\n**Images (intentionally imperfect):**\nUse ONLY:\n`festival_event.png`, `farmers_market_event.png`, `concert_event.png`, `workshop_event.png`, `fitness_class_event.png`, `food_truck_event.png`, `art_show_event.png`, `community_cleanup_event.png`, `book_club_event.png`, `kids_activity_event.png`\n\n* Most objects should use valid image names from the list\n* At least **1 object should have a broken image** (e.g., wrong filename like `\"fest_event.png\"`)\n* At least **1 object should have a missing or null image field**\n* Do not use URLs\n\n**Uneven completeness (required):**\n\n* Some objects missing fields entirely\n* Some fields set to `null` or `\"Unknown\"`\n* Descriptions vary: 2–3 sentences, 1 sentence, or missing\n* Mix specific and vague values\n* Dataset should feel inconsistent, biased, and imperfect\n\n**Output:**\nOnly return `const events = [...]` with no extra text."
      }
    },
    "bubble_choice_description": "Start with one event object, then use AI to generate a larger dataset that follows the same structure.",
